{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AN EPIC FUSION OF SCI-FI FANTASY AND PRIMAL SURVIVAL COMBAT</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_1.gif?t=1746273174\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a brutal world where humanoid animal warriors battle to save their realm from an invading cosmic force. Embody the strength of tribal heroes as you defend Feralia Terra, a once-thriving land now on the brink of annihilation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BARBARIAN FANTASY AND COSMIC HORROR, WHERE TRIBAL STRENGTH MEETS AN ALIEN THREAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/Latest_9.gif?t=1746273174\" />Unleash your feral instincts in visceral melee combat, explore corrupted landscapes, and unravel a cosmic mystery threatening all life. Reclaim your honor and restore balance to the realm.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A BRUTAL WORLD WHERE FERAL WARRIORS BATTLE TO SAVE THEIR REALM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/Latest_10.gif?t=1746273174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An intense hybrid of hack-and-slash melee and ranged weaponry, enhanced with feral abilities tied to your hero's animal lineage. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EMBODY THE STRENGTH OF TRIBAL HEROES AS YOU DEFEND FERALIA TERRA FROM ANNIHILATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_3.gif?t=1746273174\" />Traverse corrupted lush forests, highlands, villages and plains, uncovering secrets, lore, and crafting resources. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNLEASH YOUR FERAL INSTINCTS IN VISCERAL COMBAT, RECLAIM YOUR HONOR AND RESTORE THE BALANCE OF THE REALM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_2.gif?t=1746273174\" />Scavenge, craft, and adapt to harsh environments while battling twisted wildlife and cosmic horrors. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BATTLE AS FERAL WARRIOR FOR SURVIVAL AND HONOR, BOUND BY A PRIMAL CODE OF ETHICS AND FEROCITY, CONFRONT AN INVADING COSMIC EVIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_4.gif?t=1746273174\" />Face enemies, from corrupted beasts to cosmic abominations, in challenging multiphase encounters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survival is not assured in the lands of Feralia Terra. Play alone, or join forces with up to 4 players to conquer the game\u2019s challenges and unlock the greatest rewards. Face the relentless onslaught, scavenge, upgrade, and specialize to become the hero that the realm of Feralia Terra needs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/ArtnrollGames_CLASH_HOFT_5.gif?t=1746273174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2512550?t=1746273174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746273174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/7ed3fcacb6a822307ed662867e13842cce45812a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746273174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/7ed3fcacb6a822307ed662867e13842cce45812a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746273174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1}